        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D05-K300 Sunburst Decorative Door Knob</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sunburst decorative door knob is unobtrusive but visually rewarding for people who notice fine detail. Simple elegance in a door knob design made popular in the 1930\"s. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<B>Specifications</B> of Brass Accents D05-K300 Sunburst Decorative Door Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard 2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available in 13 Finishes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<B>Available Functions</B> Sunburst Decorative Door Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
